      "id": "github:225245314",
      "name": "LibreLingo",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "社区所有的开源语言学习 Web 应用：课程按 Courses > Modules > Skills 分层并绑定特定目标语言，应用自动生成选择、输入、听写等练习并逐题判定正误、接受备选答案，保存学习进度、安排间隔重复并支持跨设备同步。仓库现已归档，官方演示站当前不可访问，但完整代码可自托管运行。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/kantord/LibreLingo",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/kantord/LibreLingo",
      "github_repository_id": 225245314,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kantord/LibreLingo/main/LICENSE",
      "features": [
        "按语言对组织的 Courses > Modules > Skills 分层课程体系",
        "由应用自动生成 cards、short input、listening、options、chips 等练习",
        "练习即时判定并接受课程作者声明的备选答案",
        "间隔重复复习队列",
        "保存并监控学习进度，支持跨设备同步"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "自托管 Web 应用（Svelte + PouchDB）"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Svelte",
        "PouchDB",
        "Python (librelingo-yaml-loader / librelingo-json-export)"
      ],
